        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: -1832, y: -322}
    - rid: 4326432144287858880
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 1f1fb9b0-f309-4a87-be14-16a70b6249b6
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: -101, y: 191}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: c26e3dae-c653-4978-a659-4ee7577ad446
          InputGuid: 931e17d6-dd75-4fb5-812a-39b7cd57a5b6
          OutputGuid: 1f1fb9b0-f309-4a87-be14-16a70b6249b6
          Text: Dalej
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "M\xF3wi\u0119 ci, Gienia, teraz to wsz\u0119dzie
          same pomioty Szatana chodz\u0105. Jak na przyk\u0142ad ten... Jak mu tam?
          Hajda."
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 693384a8fef9a524094c4a7f8e4f6f57, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Jadzia
    - rid: 4326432144287858881
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: e32b9086-af45-40a8-9129-a4d48d3d5a41
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 883, y: 197}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: c4842771-74be-49bf-aa28-2767eccf39ba
          InputGuid: 9a6056d8-375e-4a5d-9518-a928e0209116
          OutputGuid: e32b9086-af45-40a8-9129-a4d48d3d5a41
          Text: Dalej
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "A daj spok\xF3j, nawet mi o nim nie m\xF3w! Kto to
          widzia\u0142, \u017Ceby takie rzeczy w bia\u0142y dzie\u0144... A niech
          go szlag jasny trafi, krew nag\u0142a zaleje!"
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1420cf8d99147e848a0379e787e6381b, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Gienia
    - rid: 4326432144287858882
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 9a6056d8-375e-4a5d-9518-a928e0209116
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1523, y: 194}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: 79426d2a-58e9-454f-988c-0ced900fe2a7
          InputGuid: 3c179565-3b0a-4737-8cdc-3b4a565edd2d
          OutputGuid: 9a6056d8-375e-4a5d-9518-a928e0209116
          Text: "Hajda? Ten, co przejecha\u0142 staruszk\u0119 na pasach?"
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Czego tu? Matka ci\u0119 nie uczy\u0142a, \u017Ce
          nie\u0142adnie jest si\u0119 tak gapi\u0107?"
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fae910a9f7844c24fa22cdf28b989e76, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Jadzia
    - rid: 4326432144287858883
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 3c179565-3b0a-4737-8cdc-3b4a565edd2d
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2151, y: 192}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: 67f75480-38d4-4b55-82d1-9a39a3a0d2ac
          InputGuid: c3c44edf-e142-4965-be6f-0c82832b8722
          OutputGuid: 3c179565-3b0a-4737-8cdc-3b4a565edd2d
          Text: Dalej
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Ten sam! Bezbo\u017Cnik jeden, tfu! Potr\u0105ci\u0142
          nasz\u0105 kole\u017Cank\u0119, kiedy sz\u0142a na k\xF3\u0142ko r\xF3\u017Ca\u0144cowe,
          do tego unikn\u0105\u0142 odpowiedzialno\u015Bci za swoje przest\u0119pstwo!"
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c51823d45f6f65446ab2bf849cd7527a, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Gienia
    - rid: 4326432144287858884
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: c3c44edf-e142-4965-be6f-0c82832b8722
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2788, y: 194}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: c8a3fec6-b241-4a9a-a215-8aa7a7002282
          InputGuid: 908d543a-75d6-4b09-8b08-33bd654aaef5
          OutputGuid: c3c44edf-e142-4965-be6f-0c82832b8722
          Text: Dalej
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "To wszystko wina Tuska! Teraz Hajda my\u015Bli, \u017Ce
          jest ca\u0142kowicie bezkarny i poluje na nas, poczciwych emeryt\xF3w.
          A\u017C strach przez pasy przej\u015B\u0107..."
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c51823d45f6f65446ab2bf849cd7527a, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Jadzia
    - rid: 4326432144287858885
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 908d543a-75d6-4b09-8b08-33bd654aaef5
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 3420, y: 192}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: 9ceae5fc-6ccb-4ab7-89c0-b84195733e52
          InputGuid: d0e5c9a8-db79-4a4b-832c-144eea8b86d4
          OutputGuid: 908d543a-75d6-4b09-8b08-33bd654aaef5
          Text: Nie ma sprawy, babciu!
        - PortGuid: 319b78b4-8485-4318-a1e2-55b63e2ec4c3
          InputGuid: 7db92cea-e2bc-468a-800b-2e69cc1b5318
          OutputGuid: 908d543a-75d6-4b09-8b08-33bd654aaef5
          Text: "I dobrze, niech was wszystkie porozje\u017Cd\u017Ca!"
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "S\u0142uchaj, m\u0142ody cz\u0142owieku. Nabo\u017Ce\u0144stwo
          si\u0119 sko\u0144czy\u0142o dwie godziny temu, a my tu wci\u0105\u017C
          siedzimy, bo boimy si\u0119 wr\xF3ci\u0107 do domu, ten antychryst pewnie
          czai si\u0119 niedaleko jakiego\u015B przej\u015Bcia. Pom\xF3g\u0142by\u015B
          nas przeprowadzi\u0107 przez jezdni\u0119? Zrobi\u0142by\u015B dobry uczynek
          i przy okazji zarobi\u0142 troch\u0119 pieni\u0105\u017Ck\xF3w na lody."
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 279690568ed238f4796072a605b899c6, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Jadzia
    - rid: 4326432144287858886
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 300b545e-c0f9-4575-8560-d5be9bac510e
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: -83, y: -93}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: e03c84fd-4d24-4e33-b2bb-febb9178dda1
          InputGuid: 00b2730b-451c-4723-814c-2946de85ffd4
          OutputGuid: 300b545e-c0f9-4575-8560-d5be9bac510e
          Text: Dalej
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Jeszcze tu jeste\u015B, antychry\u015Bcie?"
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c51823d45f6f65446ab2bf849cd7527a, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Gienia
    - rid: 4326432144287858887
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 00b2730b-451c-4723-814c-2946de85ffd4
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 559, y: -93}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: eb903c5e-a9ce-42c1-ae94-65bf3507c19d
          InputGuid: d0e5c9a8-db79-4a4b-832c-144eea8b86d4
          OutputGuid: 00b2730b-451c-4723-814c-2946de85ffd4
          Text: Nie ma sprawy, babciu!
        - PortGuid: f0ac8a1c-392e-4ee9-acf7-c377c6643ff6
          InputGuid: 8b0ff943-5d41-4742-88cf-c18b6c0f311b
          OutputGuid: 00b2730b-451c-4723-814c-2946de85ffd4
          Text: Nie ma mowy.
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Uspok\xF3j si\u0119, Gienia. Naprawd\u0119 potrzebujemy
          twojej pomocy, m\u0142odzie\u0144cze. Pomo\u017Cesz schorowanym staruszkom?"
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 279690568ed238f4796072a605b899c6, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322c97448bea9ca46a04ae059e483d60, type: 3}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Jadzia
    - rid: 4326432144287858888
      type: {class: EndNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
